{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-watermelon-breeze","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Watermelon Breeze","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the crisp and juicy taste of ripe watermelon with a cool menthol twist in Pod Salt Freebase Watermelon Breeze. This refreshing 60ml e-liquid offers a perfect balance of fruity sweetness and breezy coolness. Available in 3mg and 6mg nicotine strengths, the Gorilla bottle ensures leak-free refilling and a smooth, flavorful vape with every puff.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Sweet Watermelon with a Cool Breeze\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCooling Effect: Light menthol icy finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreebase Formula: Ideal for rich flavor and dense clouds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991059341367,"sku":"Pod S - Watermelon Breeze - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991059374135,"sku":"Pod S - Watermelon Breeze - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-watermelon-breeze.webp?v=1763436729","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-watermelon-breeze","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




